CALMAR source licensing status

The imported CALMAR app currently has no declared source licence. Its registry
entry is NOASSERTION and its README describes the licence as TBD. This package
preserves that status for relocated scientific sources and command-line code;
package.json uses UNLICENSED rather than assigning an unconfirmed licence.

This notice grants no additional rights and does not replace the licences of
third-party dependencies, models, atlases or connectivity data. See NOTICE and
the included model.manifest.json for their original sources and provenance.
